'''Cool Japan''' (アイラブジャパン, ''Ai Rabu Japan'', '''I Love Japan''') is a 4-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
'''Current Version''': Unit Attack UP (M): Cats' attack increases by 15%.

'''Pre 4.7''': Unit Attack UP (Sm): Cats' attack increases by 10%.

