==Trivia==
*"[[wikipedia:Cool Japan|Cool Japan]]" is a term referring to aspects of Japanese culture that non-Japanese people perceive as "cool", which could include [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|ninjas]], [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|sumo wrestling]], [[Samurai Cat (Special Cat)|samurai]] and [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|sushi]].

